'''Medium storage units''' can be built in resource rooms within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It allows players to store, for the duration of the raid, 500 items that are found only within the Chambers, and 60 of the player's personal items. It requires a [[Construction]] level of 60 in order to build.

'''Note:''' Players who leave the Chambers with their personal items still stored in the storage units can retrieve them from the private storage unit next to the bank chest on the Mountain. The private storage unit '''must be emptied''' before players re-enter the Chambers of Xeric.

